message: "If you use this software or data, please cite the paper below."
title: "llm-inference-fault-tolerance: fault injection, an exactly-once gateway and KV checkpoints for streaming LLM inference"
authors:
  - family-names: Medipally
    given-names: Rajshekar
repository-code: "https://github.com/rmedipallycic/llm-inference-fault-tolerance"
url: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23781214"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.4.0"
date-released: "2026-10-29"
abstract: >-
  Open-source fault-injection harness, exactly-once streaming gateway, raw
  experiment logs and analysis scripts for a study of what streaming clients
  see when vLLM and SGLang servers fail mid-generation, and of how replica
  failover and KV-cache checkpointing shorten recovery.
keywords:
  - LLM serving
  - fault tolerance
  - fault injection
  - vLLM
  - SGLang
  - exactly-once
  - KV cache
  - checkpointing
